+        report.put("traceContract", "Samples are callback observations, not accepted-step counts. Rejected frozen-FD retries may "
+                + "repeat an iteration/state. regularizedDirection counts the stagnation-activated alternative considered/chosen, "
+                + "including subsequent complete-line-search failures in that lane, not the untouched ordinary fallback. "
+                + "No stored convergence certificate is trusted as a new certificate.");
